{
  "headline": "Voriconazole is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; supply traces to a plant with an OAI classification in 2019 and a VAI in 2022",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E5", "E6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include voriconazole as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All three Corvale sites stock the same NDC 65862089103 labeled by Aurobindo Pharma Limited.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label identifies the manufacturing plant as Aurobindo Pharma Limited (FEI 3007373532) in India.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1105823 at that plant ended 2019-09-27 and was classified OAI, known to FDA on 2019-12-26.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later inspection 1169446 ended 2022-05-10 and was classified VAI, known to FDA on 2022-08-04.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 6.3 days of 50 mg tablets on hand; Corvale Lakeside has 26.3 days and can spare 36 tablets while keeping two weeks' supply.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 36 tablets of 50 mg from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would raise East to about 9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
